{"id":"conv_04926","context":"A boss runs a meeting on a contentious policy proposal","ambient":"office_quiet_low","cast":["hiroshi_boss","kenji_office"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"hiroshi_boss","mood":null,"en":"Then let's get to today's agenda. I want to reach a conclusion on the personnel reform proposal after thorough preliminary discussion.","jp":"では本日の議題に入る。例の人事制度改革案について、事前討議を重ねた上で結論を出したい。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,5,7,8,62,75,124,326,524,745,875,944,972,1010,1528,1582,2330,3104,3198,4781,5804,7005,8387,9154,9250,11969],"jpTokens":[{"s":"では","w":1582},{"s":"本日","r":"ほんじつ","w":944},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"議題","r":"ぎだい","w":7005},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"入る","r":"はいる","w":875},{"s":"。"},{"s":"例","r":"れい","w":524},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"人事","r":"じんじ","w":3198},{"s":"制度","r":"せいど","w":326},{"s":"改革","r":"かいかく","w":745},{"s":"案","r":"あん","w":972},{"s":"について","w":75},{"s":"、"},{"s":"事前","r":"じぜん","w":2330},{"s":"討議","r":"とうぎ","w":8387},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"重ね","r":"かさね","w":9250},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"上","r":"うえ","w":124},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"結論","r":"けつろん","w":1528},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"出し","r":"だし","w":1010},{"s":"たい","w":62},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"kenji_office","mood":null,"en":"Director, speaking frankly, I believe this proposal risks causing confusion on the ground.","jp":"部長、率直に申し上げますが、現場に混乱を引き起こす恐れがある案かと存じます。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,5,6,9,14,16,22,590,972,1039,1434,2620,2640,2734,2823,3288,5071,5571,8437,15765],"jpTokens":[{"s":"部長","r":"ぶちょう","w":2620},{"s":"、"},{"s":"率直","r":"そっちょく","w":5071},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"申し上げ","r":"もうしあげ","w":5571},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"、"},{"s":"現場","r":"げんば","w":1039},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"混乱","r":"こんらん","w":2640},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"引き起こす","r":"ひきおこす","w":8437},{"s":"恐れ","r":"おそれ","w":2734},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"ある","w":22},{"s":"案","r":"あん","w":972},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"存じ","r":"ぞんじ","w":3288},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_boss","mood":null,"en":"I understand the concern. But I want a system that advances efficiency and at the same time secures employee buy-in.","jp":"懸念は分かる。だが効率化を進め、なおかつ社員の納得感も得る制度にしたいんだ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,5,11,19,21,26,62,123,326,408,1006,1076,1118,1457,1465,1512,1805,2755,2837,3501,4781,8444,11969,13942],"jpTokens":[{"s":"懸念","r":"けねん","w":3501},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"分かる","r":"わかる","w":1805},{"s":"。"},{"s":"だが","w":1118},{"s":"効率","r":"こうりつ","w":1512},{"s":"化","r":"か","w":123},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"進め","r":"すすめ","w":2837},{"s":"、"},{"s":"なおかつ","w":8444},{"s":"社員","r":"しゃいん","w":1465},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"納得","r":"なっとく","w":1457},{"s":"感","r":"かん","w":408},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"得る","r":"える","w":1006},{"s":"制度","r":"せいど","w":326},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"たい","w":62},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"kenji_office","mood":null,"en":"I understand the intent. However, at this rate the discussion will run on parallel lines and we won't reach a conclusion.","jp":"ご趣旨は承知しております。ただこのままでは議論が平行線をたどり、結論が出ないかと存じます。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[3,4,5,6,7,9,13,14,16,19,31,127,247,361,419,516,722,1059,1528,2010,2230,3288,8415,13947],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ご","w":127},{"s":"趣旨","r":"しゅし","w":2230},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"承知","r":"しょうち","w":2010},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"おり","w":361},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"},{"s":"ただ","w":247},{"s":"この","w":31},{"s":"まま","w":419},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"議論","r":"ぎろん","w":516},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"平行","r":"へいこう","w":8415},{"s":"線","r":"せん","w":1059},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"たどり","w":13947},{"s":"、"},{"s":"結論","r":"けつろん","w":1528},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"出","r":"で","w":722},{"s":"ない","w":13},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"存じ","r":"ぞんじ","w":3288},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_boss","mood":null,"en":"That's precisely why I believe we need a framework that treats managers and rank-and-file employees as equals.","jp":"